-f8915f4f016e3fbb0ee0","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-630d90f48255ffda7b80","layer":"pei","quote":"诣都督高顺营，直排顺门入。顺问：‘将军有所隐不？’布言：‘河内儿声。’顺言：‘此郝萌也。’顺即严兵入府，弓弩并射萌众。萌众乱走，天明还故营","attribution":"裴注·英雄记","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":76,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c3c03b97c67239fef561","start":252,"end":321,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
